flowchart TB
    accTitle: 依存先・プロトコル（レビュー案）
    accDescr: Core APIはmetadataとfile URLを返し、専用File ServerがHDDからbytesを直接配信する。APIとFile ServerはTailnet限定。矢印は呼び出し側から依存先。
    subgraph APP[Photo App]
        Viewer[Viewer<br/>HTTP client]
        Uploader[Uploader<br/>HTTP client]
    end
    Share[Share API<br/>HTTP server]
    subgraph CORE[Core]
        API[Core API<br/>metadata・file URL<br/>HTTP server]
        Worker[Core Worker<br/>background]
        Files[File Server<br/>Nginx等・技術候補<br/>GET / HEAD / Range]
    end
    subgraph SEARCH[Searcher]
        Search[Search API<br/>HTTP server]
        Indexer[Index Worker<br/>background]
    end
    DB[(PostgreSQL)]
    HDD[(HDD)]
    Index[(Search Index<br/>shared storage<br/>技術未定)]

    Viewer -->|一覧・詳細<br/>Tailnet HTTPS REST/JSON| API
    Viewer -->|file URL<br/>Tailnet HTTPS<br/>GET / HEAD / Range bytes| Files
    Viewer -->|検索<br/>HTTPS REST/JSON| Search
    Uploader -->|HTTPS<br/>multipart/form-data| API
    Share -->|共有・メディア<br/>HTTPS REST/JSON| API
    Indexer -->|indexing・changes<br/>HTTPS REST/JSON| API
    API -->|SQL / TCP| DB
    API -->|原本アップロード保存<br/>POSIX I/O| HDD
    Worker -->|jobs・lease<br/>SQL / TCP| DB
    Worker -->|原本読取・生成物保存<br/>POSIX I/O| HDD
    Files -->|readonly<br/>POSIX I/O| HDD
    Indexer -->|write| Index
    Search -->|read| Index

    classDef app fill:#ffffff,stroke:#94a9bf,color:#203047
    classDef core fill:#203c59,stroke:#203c59,color:#ffffff
    classDef search fill:#e5eef8,stroke:#94a9bf,color:#203047
    classDef storage fill:#eef3f7,stroke:#94a9bf,color:#203047
    class Viewer,Uploader,Share app
    class API,Worker,Files core
    class Search,Indexer search
    class DB,HDD,Index storage
    style APP fill:#f5f7fa,stroke:#94a9bf
    style CORE fill:#eef3f7,stroke:#94a9bf
    style SEARCH fill:#f5f7fa,stroke:#94a9bf
